{
  "name": "Ward",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/explosion.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You impart vigilant magic into a location to protect the area from trespass.</p><p>Spend <strong>10 minutes</strong> to enact a simple ritual and choose a point within <strong>10 spaces</strong>.</p><p>For <strong>1 hour</strong>, whenever a creature enters or leaves (one or both at your discretion) within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point, a magical alarm sounds goes off.</p><p>You decide the volume and specific sound generated. You may select specific creatures or types of creatures (i.e. <em>Humans</em>, <em>Beasts</em>, etc.) that will or will not trigger the ward.</p><p>Additionally, you set a password that creatures may speak to avoid triggering the alarm when breaching the area’s boundaries.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 hours</strong>.</p>",
